{"seq":2,"slug":"snapshot-incremental-handshake","title":"全量快照与增量衔接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/commerce-cdc-change-data-platform/log-mining-foundation/snapshot-incremental-handshake","wordCount":2234,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"全量快照与增量衔接\">全量快照与增量衔接</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>新接入一张已经有两亿行、每秒三千次写入的商品表，你面对的是一个「既要又要」的问题：既要拿到一份<strong>一致的全量基线</strong>（不能一半是今天的数据、一半是昨天的），又要<strong>紧跟着增量流</strong>（不能停下来等基线跑完再追，那时基线已经过期了），还要<strong>不影响线上</strong>（不能锁表，不能让主库的读 IO 打满）。这是 CDC 工程里技术含量最高、也最容易出错的环节——所有的衔接缝隙都在这里。</p>\n<p>问题的本质是一个<strong>读取一致性</strong>问题。假设你在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时刻开始读全量，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时刻读完，然后从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 开始消费增量。那么在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(t_0, t_1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 之间发生的修改，如果已经体现在全量数据里（因为它在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之后被读到），增量流里<strong>也会</strong>出现（因为它在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之前提交），这就是重复；如果它体现在全量里但增量流从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之后才起，则碰到的是缺失。所以正确做法不是「读完之后从当前位点开始」，而是：<strong>先固定一个位点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，再从「与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 一致的数据快照」里读全量，然后从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 开始消费增量</strong>。这样任何变更要么在快照里、要么在 &gt; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 的增量里，恰好一次覆盖。</p>\n<p>「与位点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 一致的数据快照」是全部难点所在。MySQL 提供了一条现成的路径：InnoDB 的 MVCC 快照 + <code>START TRANSACTION WITH CONSISTENT SNAPSHOT</code>，配合 <code>SHOW MASTER STATUS</code> 拿到位点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 会话 A：固定一致性视图并取位点&#10;SET SESSION TRANSACTION ISOLATION LEVEL REPEATABLE READ;&#10;FLUSH TABLES WITH READ LOCK;              -- 全局读锁，仅为取位点&#10;START TRANSACTION WITH CONSISTENT SNAPSHOT;&#10;SHOW MASTER STATUS;                       -- 记录 File / Position / Executed_Gtid_Set&#10;UNLOCK TABLES;                            -- 立即释放，之后的读靠 MVCC 快照&#10;-- 从这里开始的 SELECT 都看到同一份视图&#10;SELECT id, title, price, stock, updated_at FROM products WHERE id &gt; ? ORDER BY id LIMIT 5000;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 会话 A：固定一致性视图并取位点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SESSION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TRANSACTION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ISOLATION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LEVEL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REPEATABLE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> READ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">FLUSH TABLES </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> READ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LOCK;              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 全局读锁，仅为取位点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">START TRANSACTION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONSISTENT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SNAPSHOT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">SHOW </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MASTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> STATUS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;                       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 记录 File / Position / Executed_Gtid_Set</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UNLOCK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TABLES;                            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 立即释放，之后的读靠 MVCC 快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 从这里开始的 SELECT 都看到同一份视图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id, title, price, stock, updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>FLUSH TABLES WITH READ LOCK</code>（FTWRL）虽然只持有毫秒级，但在高写入负载下它会造成连接堆积，是生产环境常见的抖动源。Debezium 的默认做法是<strong>最小化锁的持有时间</strong>：只在取位点那一刻持锁（<code>FLUSH TABLES WITH READ LOCK</code> → 取位点 → <code>START TRANSACTION WITH CONSISTENT SNAPSHOT</code> → 释放锁），随后全量读取完全走 MVCC 快照，不阻塞写入。这个顺序不能颠倒：如果先开事务再取位点，取到的位点对应的事务快照可能晚于你的读快照，会产生缝隙。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant C as Connector&#10;  participant M as MySQL 主库&#10;  participant K as Kafka&#10;  C-&gt;&gt;M: FLUSH TABLES WITH READ LOCK&#10;  C-&gt;&gt;M: START TRANSACTION WITH CONSISTENT SNAPSHOT&#10;  C-&gt;&gt;M: SHOW MASTER STATUS -&gt; 位点 P&#10;  C-&gt;&gt;M: UNLOCK TABLES&#10;  par 全量读取(MVCC 快照,不阻塞写)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;M: SELECT ... 按主键分片扫描&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;K: 以 read 操作写入 topic&#10;  and 增量捕获(同时进行)&#10;    M--&gt;&gt;C: binlog 流(从 P 之后)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;K: 以 c/u/d 操作写入 topic&#10;  end&#10;  Note over C,K: 位点 P 保证两者无缝隙、无重复\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant C as Connector\n  participant M as MySQL 主库\n  participant K as Kafka\n  C-&gt;&gt;M: FLUSH TABLES WITH READ LOCK\n  C-&gt;&gt;M: START TRANSACTION WITH CONSISTENT SNAPSHOT\n  C-&gt;&gt;M: SHOW MASTER STATUS -&gt; 位点 P\n  C-&gt;&gt;M: UNLOCK TABLES\n  par 全量读取(MVCC 快照,不阻塞写)\n    C-&gt;&gt;M: SELECT ... 按主键分片扫描\n    C-&gt;&gt;K: 以 read 操作写入 topic\n  and 增量捕获(同时进行)\n    M--&gt;&gt;C: binlog 流(从 P 之后)\n    C-&gt;&gt;K: 以 c/u/d 操作写入 topic\n  end\n  Note over C,K: 位点 P 保证两者无缝隙、无重复</pre><h2 id=\"快照模式的选择\">快照模式的选择</h2><p>连接器通常把快照策略做成一个可配置项（Debezium 叫 <code>snapshot.mode</code>）。理解每个选项意味着放弃什么，比记住名字重要：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>首次启动做什么</th>\n<th>之后重启做什么</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>initial</code>（默认）</td>\n<td>快照 + 从位点转增量</td>\n<td>只从已存位点续传</td>\n<td>首次接入一张新表</td>\n<td>大表快照耗时长、占带宽</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>schema_only</code></td>\n<td>只捕获 schema 并记录位点，<strong>不读数据</strong></td>\n<td>只捕增量</td>\n<td>只要变更流、下游自行初始化</td>\n<td>下游缺基线，需要另外的手段补</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>schema_only_recovery</code></td>\n<td>不读数据，从已存 schema 历史恢复</td>\n<td>只捕增量</td>\n<td>从崩溃中恢复一个 schema_only 连接器</td>\n<td>若 schema 历史损坏则无法恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>when_needed</code></td>\n<td>检测到位点不可用（binlog 已被清理/GTID 不匹配）时才快照</td>\n<td>通常只捕增量</td>\n<td>长期运行、容忍偶发重快照</td>\n<td>重快照会向下游重发全量记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>no_data</code></td>\n<td>捕获 schema 后停止</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>纯结构同步</td>\n<td>不是完整方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>initial_only</code></td>\n<td>快照后<strong>停止</strong>，不转增量</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>一次性导出</td>\n<td>需手动重启为其他模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"为什么-initial-比-when_needed-安全\">为什么 initial 比 when_needed 安全</h3><p>绝大多数生产事故围绕 <code>initial</code> 与 <code>when_needed</code> 的差别展开。<code>initial</code> 的问题是「位点失效后连接器会报错停止」，这是安全的失败方式；<code>when_needed</code> 的问题是「位点失效后它会静默重做一次全量快照」，下游会突然收到两亿条 <code>read</code> 事件——如果下游没做幂等，这会触发一次大规模的重复写入和告警风暴。<strong>新接入用 <code>initial</code>，且把「位点失效」当成需要人工判断的事件，而不是自动重快照。</strong> 后者看起来更&quot;自愈&quot;，实际是把一个可观测的故障换成了一个不可观测的数据事件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"快照读取的工程细节\">快照读取的工程细节</h2><p><strong>分片并行读取</strong>。### 分片并行读取</p>\n<p>单线程扫两亿行在本库里可能要几小时（受 IO 与返回带宽限制），所以连接器通常会按主键区间并行。分片策略有两种，差别在如何处理数据分布不均：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 做法 A：等宽区间（实现简单，但热点表会倾斜）&#10;-- 假设 min(id)=1, max(id)=200000000, 切 8 片&#10;SELECT * FROM products WHERE id &gt;= 1        AND id &lt; 25000001 ORDER BY id;&#10;SELECT * FROM products WHERE id &gt;= 25000001 AND id &lt; 50000001 ORDER BY id;&#10;-- ...&#10;SELECT * FROM products WHERE id &gt;= 175000001 AND id &lt; 200000001 ORDER BY id;&#10;&#10;-- 做法 B：按主键抽样求分位（分布均匀，但需额外一次查询）&#10;SELECT id FROM products WHERE id % 1000 = 0 ORDER BY id;  -- 抽样 ≈ 20 万个边界&#10;-- 取第 1/8、2/8 ... 个样本作为切分点\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 做法 A：等宽区间（实现简单，但热点表会倾斜）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 假设 min(id)=1, max(id)=200000000, 切 8 片</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 25000001</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 25000001</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50000001</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 175000001</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 200000001</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 做法 B：按主键抽样求分位（分布均匀，但需额外一次查询）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> products </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id % </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id;  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 抽样 ≈ 20 万个边界</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 取第 1/8、2/8 ... 个样本作为切分点</span></span></code></pre></div><p>做法 B 的代价是那一次抽样查询本身（它可能扫全表），收益是切片大小接近。对于自增主键的表，做法 A 已经足够均匀；对于 UUID 主键或带有大量删除的表，做法 A 会出现「某片 0 行、某片 8000 万行」的极端情况，此时必须用 B。切片数不是越多越好：每个切片需要一个数据库连接与一份缓冲区，且切片数超过表上的数据分布粒度后会退化成大量空扫描。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一致性快照与-undo-的压力\">一致性快照与 undo 的压力</h3><p><strong>一致性快照的持有时长</strong>是一个容易被忽略的资源问题。MVCC 快照要求 InnoDB 保留所有比它更新的 undo 版本，也就是说：<strong>快照开着的这段时间，purge 线程无法回收这段时间内产生的所有 undo 日志</strong>。一张两亿行的表如果快照跑 4 小时，而这 4 小时里有每秒 3000 次写入，undo 表空间会持续膨胀，极端情况下撑满磁盘导致线上写入失败。这是「大表快照的最大风险」——它不表现为 CDC 平台的问题，而表现为源库磁盘告警。缓解手段：控制单次快照的时长（提高并行度、避开业务高峰）、监控 undo 表空间、必要时用「分片多次快照 + 每片独立短事务」代替单一大事务（代价是最终不再是单一一致性视图，需要下游按位点做对齐）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"检查点与断点续传\">检查点与断点续传</h3><p><strong>检查点与断点续传</strong>。快照跑到 60% 崩溃了，重启时应当从哪里继续？如果从头重跑，代价是重来一遍；如果从 60% 继续，必须确保「已写入的那 60% 与重启后的 40% 属于同一个快照视图」。Debezium 的做法是把快照进度也记入 offset（一个 <code>snapshot_record</code> 标记 + 各切片的完成状态），重启后跳过已完成的切片，并对未完成的切片重新开始——代价是切片级的重复（该切片已写的部分会再写一次），所以<strong>下游必须对 <code>read</code> 事件幂等</strong>（按主键 upsert 天然幂等，见 <code>../3_downstream-search-cache-warehouse/1_sync-change-to-search-index.md</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"快照与增量的汇合点\">快照与增量的汇合点</h2><p>全量读出的是「某行在某时刻的样子」，增量给出的是「某行发生了什么变化」。### op 字段与幂等 upsert</p>\n<p>下游要把这两者合并成一条时间线，就必须能区分两者的语义。Debezium 用 envelope 里的 <code>op</code> 字段表达：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><code>op</code></th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>下游应做的动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>r</code></td>\n<td>read，来自快照</td>\n<td>upsert（按主键覆盖）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>c</code></td>\n<td>create，来自 INSERT</td>\n<td>upsert</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>u</code></td>\n<td>update，来自 UPDATE</td>\n<td>upsert（用 after）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>d</code></td>\n<td>delete，来自 DELETE</td>\n<td>delete</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>t</code></td>\n<td>truncate，来自 TRUNCATE TABLE</td>\n<td>清空该表对应集合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键点是 <code>r</code> 和 <code>c</code> 在下游<strong>几乎总是被同等处理</strong>（都是 upsert），但它们在语义上不同：<code>r</code> 可能对应一行早已存在的数据，<code>c</code> 一定是新行。这个差别只在<strong>事件溯源风格的下游</strong>（关心「这件事是不是真的发生了」）里才重要；对「维护一份当前视图」的下游，<code>r</code>/<code>c</code>/<code>u</code> 都是 upsert。把 <code>r</code> 也当成 upsert 是绝大多数场景的正确选择，它使快照重跑变得安全。</p>\n<p>一个真实的汇合顺序示例：位点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 之后，商品 7 经历了一次 <code>UPDATE</code>（价格 129 → 99）。因为快照读的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 时刻的视图，快照里商品 7 的价格是 129；增量流里从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 开始也会有这次 UPDATE，下游先 upsert(129) 再 upsert(99)，终态正确。如果快照是「读完才定位点」（错误做法），位点变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时刻的值，这次 UPDATE 就落在缝隙里——下游终态停留在 129。这就是「先定位点再读快照」这条规则的全部意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>正确顺序是「<strong>先固定位点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，再读与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 一致的快照，再从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 消费增量</strong>」；颠倒顺序会产生不可修复的数据缝隙。</li>\n<li>快照读靠 InnoDB MVCC 快照 + <code>START TRANSACTION WITH CONSISTENT SNAPSHOT</code>，<code>FLUSH TABLES WITH READ LOCK</code> 只需覆盖取位点那一瞬。</li>\n<li><code>snapshot.mode</code> 里最需要斟酌的是 <code>initial</code> 与 <code>when_needed</code>：后者位点失效时会静默重做全量，把可观测故障变成不可观测的数据事件。</li>\n<li>大表快照的真实风险在源库：长事务阻止 undo 回收，会撑大 undo 表空间。快照并行度、时长与 undo 监控需要一起规划。</li>\n<li>快照中断续传会产生切片级重复，因此下游必须把 <code>r</code>/<code>c</code>/<code>u</code> 统一按幂等 upsert 处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一步：位点本身用什么形式表达、主从切换后是否仍有效，见 <a href=\"gtid-offset-ordering\">GTID 位点与全局顺序</a>；连接器如何配置这些模式，见 <a href=\"../connector-capture/debezium-connector-config\">Debezium 连接器配置</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"全量快照与增量衔接","id":"全量快照与增量衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"快照模式的选择","id":"快照模式的选择"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么 initial 比 when_needed 安全","id":"为什么-initial-比-when_needed-安全"},{"level":2,"text":"快照读取的工程细节","id":"快照读取的工程细节"},{"level":3,"text":"一致性快照与 undo 的压力","id":"一致性快照与-undo-的压力"},{"level":3,"text":"检查点与断点续传","id":"检查点与断点续传"},{"level":2,"text":"快照与增量的汇合点","id":"快照与增量的汇合点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"binlog 与行镜像解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/commerce-cdc-change-data-platform/log-mining-foundation/binlog-row-image-parse"},"next":{"title":"GTID 位点与全局顺序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/commerce-cdc-change-data-platform/log-mining-foundation/gtid-offset-ordering"}}